From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: test <test@example.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:32:48 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix: stop skipping dialogs by date

Stock pagination picked the oldest message of a page as the getDialogs offset, including old pinned top messages: everything between that date and the real page bottom was never fetched. dialogsLoadedTillDate got poisoned the same way and sortDialogs then hid loaded old chats in every folder. Now the offset uses the oldest non-pinned top message per dialog (split for channels), and the till-date filter skips pinned dialogs and tracks channels separately.
